The [[Grimoire]] adds a number of new and changed spells to ''Neverwinter Nights''.
In order not to violate any copyrights, the descriptions for the following [[spell]]s only include publicly available information from the [[Wizards of the Coast]] web site, either through articles they have published, downloadable .pdf web enhancements to sourcebooks, or the [[SRD]].  To otherwise read a spell's description, please refer to the referenced source, or view the ingame description.

*Classes in parenthesis do not currently receive spells in game.  They may be added as abilities if possible.  Also, this list is updated for version 3.0 of the Grimoire, which is not yet available for download.

